{"translation":{"id":"kan_irv","name":"ಇಂಡಿಯನ್ ರಿವೈಜ್ಡ್ ವರ್ಸನ್ (IRV) - ಕನ್ನಡ - 2019","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=kanirv","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Kannada Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"kan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"82cc741009376c81c4416c230a757b2e30ef49b2e4672f9831adcedfc26b865f","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31031,"languageName":"ಕನ್ನಡ","languageEnglishName":"Kannada"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"kan_irv","name":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","commonName":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","title":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆಗಳು","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08dbfe5ddc486dec386dace7278fb86473155bcc396458e2e5b52a02b2d0a830","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":100,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ಲೋಕವೆಲ್ಲಾ ಇಸ್ರಾಯೇಲರ ದೇವರನ್ನು ಆರಾಧಿಸಬೇಕೆಂಬ ಬೋಧನೆ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ಕೃತಜ್ಞತಾಯಜ್ಞ ಕೀರ್ತನೆ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ಸಮಸ್ತಭೂನಿವಾಸಿಗಳೇ, ಯೆಹೋವನಿಗೆ ಉತ್ಸಾಹಧ್ವನಿಮಾಡಿರಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನನ್ನು ಸಂತೋಷದಿಂದ ಸೇವಿಸಿರಿ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಕೀರ್ತನೆ ಹಾಡುತ್ತಾ ಆತನ ಸನ್ನಿಧಿಗೆ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನೇ ದೇವರೆಂದು ತಿಳಿದುಕೊಳ್ಳಿರಿ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಮ್ಮನ್ನು ಉಂಟುಮಾಡಿದವನು ಆತನೇ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ನಾವು ಆತನವರು, ಆತನ ಪ್ರಜೆಯೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನು ಪಾಲಿಸುವ ಹಿಂಡೂ ಆಗಿದ್ದೇವೆ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಕೃತಜ್ಞತಾ ಸ್ತುತಿಯೊಡನೆ ಆತನ ಮಂದಿರದ್ವಾರಗಳಿಗೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಸ್ತುತಿಸ್ತೋತ್ರದೊಡನೆ ಆತನ ಅಂಗಳಗಳಿಗೂ ಬನ್ನಿರಿ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಉಪಕಾರಗಳನ್ನು ಸ್ಮರಿಸಿರಿ;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ನಾಮವನ್ನು ಕೊಂಡಾಡಿರಿ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಯೆಹೋವನು ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವನು;","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಕೃಪೆಯು ಯುಗಯುಗಕ್ಕೂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ಆತನ ಸತ್ಯತೆಯು ತಲತಲಾಂತರಕ್ಕೂ ಇರುವವು.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/100.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/101.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kan_irv/PSA/99.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}